WEBVTT

00:00:00.700 --> 00:00:02.270
But there's one problem.

00:00:02.270 --> 00:00:05.480
This monkey doesn't have a name yet.

00:00:05.720 --> 00:00:06.650
How about Jugem?

00:00:06.650 --> 00:00:07.860
Let's call him Shit-Tosser!

00:00:08.080 --> 00:00:09.430
Runny Diarrhea?

00:00:09.430 --> 00:00:11.330
How about Shin-chan's 
Two-Day-Old Underwear?

00:00:11.330 --> 00:00:12.930
Let's just name him 
Shinpachi's Sorry Life.

00:00:12.930 --> 00:00:14.280
How about Balmung Fezalion?

00:00:14.540 --> 00:00:15.990
Issac Schneider.

00:00:15.990 --> 00:00:17.320
Okay, finished.

00:00:17.320 --> 00:00:18.620
That's frickin' long!

00:00:18.870 --> 00:00:20.910
I have bad news for her.

00:00:20.910 --> 00:00:23.360
Though it's good news for me.

00:00:23.360 --> 00:00:27.040
The shogun's family has requested 
the return of the monkey.

00:00:27.570 --> 00:00:29.380
You don't need to feel sad.

00:00:30.690 --> 00:00:33.220
It doesn't matter how 
far apart we are...

00:00:33.600 --> 00:00:37.270
I'll always be by your side.

00:00:38.700 --> 00:00:40.010
Take care.

00:03:29.820 --> 00:03:35.820
