00:07:29.580 --> 00:07:30.680
Y-You are...

00:07:30.930 --> 00:07:32.180
<b>Issac Schneider
Also known as the Prince of Light.</b>

00:07:31.450 --> 00:07:32.950
The Prince of Light...

00:07:32.180 --> 00:07:33.430
<b>Balmung's younger twin brother.</b>

00:07:32.950 --> 00:07:34.700
