00:07:33.430 --> 00:07:34.690
<b>While his brother was abandoned at 
young age, Issac was able to live in comfort.</b>

00:07:34.690 --> 00:07:35.940
<b>He realizes his father's 
dark intentions,</b>

00:07:34.700 --> 00:07:36.060
