focus on defeating him.

00:07:42.830 --> 00:07:45.250
Hmph, don't expect me to thank you.

00:07:45.250 --> 00:07:46.250
Brother...

00:07:47.570 --> 00:07:49.010
Let's do this!

00:07:49.760 --> 00:07:51.530
Hey, hey give me your body,

00:07:51.530 --> 00:07:52.920
no, no, that's all I need.

00:07:52.920 --> 00:07:55.080
Kiss on my lips to shut it up!

00:07:55.080 --> 00:07:56.220
Don't touch me!

00:07:56.220 --> 00:07:58.410
Hey, hey I don't anything!

00:07:58.410 --> 00:08:00.030
Any more about me,

00:08:00.030 --> 00:08:01.920
wow, wow, wow, wow,

00:08:01.920 --> 00:08:03.140
wow, wow, wow!

00:08:03.140 --> 00:08:05.160
Bad communication!

00:08:05.620 --> 00:08:08.790
Then they form a band, 
which is now known as B'z.

00:08:08.470 --> 00:08:09.850
<b>The End</b>

00:08:08.790 --> 00:08:10.130
Hold on a second!

00:08:10.130 --> 00:08:11.930
That's how the story ends?!

00:08:11.930 --> 00:08:13.980
They're just going to 
ignore their father?!

00:08:13.980 --> 00:08:15.530
I had to suppress my 
instincts and think hard

00:08:15.530 --> 00:08:17.100
all night to come up with this ending.

00:08:17.110 --> 00:08:20.470
Don't act like you actually put 
any thought into this crap!

00:08:23.390 --> 00:08:26.040
Yes, who is it?

00:08:26.540 --> 00:08:28.360
Tojo-san?

00:08:28.360 --> 00:08:30.920
D-D-D-

00:08:30.920 --> 00:08:32.870
Damn it all!

00:08:32.870 --> 00:08:36.590
That monkey ran away after three days!

00:08:36.590 --> 00:08:40.390
It's managed to run around the 
city while evading all pursuit!

00:08:40.390 --> 00:08:42.960
As a result, the Yagyu 
family has been accused

00:08:42.960 --> 00:08:45.160
of failing to properly train the monkey,

00:08:45.160 --> 00:08:49.760
and every single member has been 
forced to search for the monkey!

00:08:50.060 --> 00:08:52.370
I knew that would happen.

00:08:52.370 --> 00:08:55.770
The beast isn't going to listen 
to anyone besides Kyubei.

00:08:56.070 --> 00:08:57.810
Serves them right.

00:08:57.810 --> 00:09:01.060
That's what happens when you take 
someone's pet away from them.

00:09:01.060 --> 00:09:03.270
This isn't the time to be gloating!

00:09:03.270 --> 00:09:05.230
The lady has been 
searching for the monkey

00:09:05.230 --> 00:09:07.850
for the past three 
days without any rest!

00:09:07.850 --> 00:09:11.990
She's so worried that she's 
barely eaten anything!

00:09:12.210 --> 00:09:15.130
And if we can't find the monkey,

00:09:15.130 --> 00:09:18.830
the lady will have to disembowel 
herself as punishment!

00:09:20.170 --> 00:09:22.590
That sounds extreme for one monkey...

00:09:23.750 --> 00:09:25.490
Yes, this is Tojo...

00:09:24.000 --> 00:09:26.880
What are you doing?! Haven't 
you found the monkey?!

00:09:26.880 --> 00:09:28.630
I-I'm very sorry!

00:09:28.630 --> 00:09:30.510
Please wait just a little longer!

00:09:30.510 --> 00:09:32.200
Do you understand?!

00:09:32.200 --> 00:09:34.550
That monkey was a gift from the shogun!

00:09:34.550 --> 00:09:38.160
If anything happens, the responsibility 
will lie with the Yagyu!

00:09:38.160 --> 00:09:39.710
Hey, Gramps.

00:09:39.710 --> 00:09:42.240
Did Goku come back yet?

00:09:42.240 --> 00:09:44.790
Don't worry, young master.

00:09:44.790 --> 00:09:47.230
Goku will be back very soon.

00:09:47.230 --> 00:09:49.100
Hey! You hear me, Tojo?!

00:09:49.100 --> 00:09:52.030
I'm sure that you know what 
will happen if you fail!

00:09:52.030 --> 00:09:53.390
Worry not.

00:09:53.390 --> 00:09:56.730
I was able to secure 
Shit-Tosser's favorite target.

00:09:56.730 --> 00:09:59.270
Yes, if we use Shit-Tossed as bait,

00:09:59.270 --> 00:10:03.670
Goku will come to throw 
shit at him, yes.

00:10:06.330 --> 00:10:08.970
Hey, when you say Shit-Tossed, 
you're referring to this, right?

00:10:08.970 --> 00:10:09.970
You don't mean me, right?

00:10:09.970 --> 00:10:11.210
Please!

00:10:11.210 --> 00:10:14.430
Think of this as a sacrifice 
for the lady's sake!

00:10:14.430 --> 00:10:17.690
Bastard! You're going to use 
me as a shit receptacle?!

00:10:14.430 --> 00:10:28.900
<b>Toilet</b>

00:10:17.690 --> 00:10:21.380
That monkey is obsessed 
with throwing shit at you!

00:10:21.380 --> 00:10:26.640
We can use that obsession 
to draw him out!

00:10:26.640 --> 00:10:30.260
You're going to just let the lady die?!

00:10:30.260 --> 00:10:32.450
You're going to let me 
be covered in shit?!

00:10:32.770 --> 00:10:33.730
Does it really matter?

00:10:33.730 --> 00:10:34.780
It's not like you're losing anything.

00:10:34.780 --> 00:10:37.580
I'm losing something deep inside 
that I can never have back!

00:10:37.830 --> 00:10:42.810
You were always aloof like 
the gas from a septic tank.

00:10:42.810 --> 00:10:44.920
Normally, you say that a 
person is aloof like a cloud!

00:10:44.920 --> 00:10:47.420
How does that metaphor even work 
with the gas from a septic tank?!

00:10:47.420 --> 00:10:48.330
Gin-san!

00:10:48.330 --> 00:10:49.590
Gin-san! Look!

00:10:49.820 --> 00:10:51.340
