00:11:37.430 --> 00:11:38.850
Hey! Hold on!

00:11:38.850 --> 00:11:39.960
Monkey!

00:11:39.960 --> 00:11:41.410
Show yourself!

00:11:41.410 --> 00:11:44.430
I've brought your favorite 
shit receptacle!

00:11:44.430 --> 00:11:45.570
Now get your ass out here!

00:11:45.570 --> 00:11:48.260
Unload your shit!

00:11:54.440 --> 00:11:56.410
Hey! What's going on?!

00:11:56.630 --> 00:12:00.500
All of the monkeys are aiming for me!

00:12:00.500 --> 00:12:01.390
What is this?!

00:12:01.390 --> 00:12:03.030
What do they think about me?!

00:12:03.030 --> 00:12:04.410
How do they see me?!

00:12:04.410 --> 00:12:07.670
Was one of your ancestors 
a crab, or perhaps Frieza?!

00:12:07.880 --> 00:12:08.820
No, that's not it.

00:12:08.820 --> 00:12:10.540
Gin-chan is descended from gas

00:12:10.540 --> 00:12:12.180
