the oldest trick in the book?

00:12:31.020 --> 00:12:32.440
We can make it work if 
we have the numbers!

00:12:33.110 --> 00:12:34.050
What?

00:12:34.050 --> 00:12:36.260
A monkey that has a 
bell around its neck?

00:12:36.260 --> 00:12:37.570
And its name is...

00:12:37.950 --> 00:12:40.620
Uh, it's Jugem Jugem Poop-Tossing...

00:12:40.620 --> 00:12:41.580
You got it wrong.

00:12:41.580 --> 00:12:42.790
It's Shit-Tossing.

00:12:42.790 --> 00:12:43.950
Oh, what she said.

00:12:44.270 --> 00:12:46.820
Uh, Jugem Jugem Shit-Tossing the

00:12:46.820 --> 00:12:49.620
Life of Shin-chan's 
<i>One-Day</i>-Old Underwear...

