00:13:12.430 --> 00:13:13.210
Huh?

00:13:13.210 --> 00:13:16.740
Right, so when did Shin-chan 
get shit on his underwear?

00:13:16.950 --> 00:13:18.600
Uh, when was it?

00:13:18.600 --> 00:13:19.580
