00:14:09.590 --> 00:14:10.410
Yes.

00:14:10.410 --> 00:14:11.830
What? Is that true?

00:14:12.080 --> 00:14:13.590
Thank you so much!

00:14:13.590 --> 00:14:15.850
I don't know how to thank you.

00:14:15.850 --> 00:14:17.800
I appreciate the help!

00:14:18.130 --> 00:14:19.860
Rejoice!

00:14:19.860 --> 00:14:22.970
