00:14:29.220 --> 00:14:30.320
Really?!

00:14:30.320 --> 00:14:31.750
I don't see how he was 
able to remember the name.

00:14:31.750 --> 00:14:33.110
Ah, Elizabeth!

00:14:33.110 --> 00:14:34.730
Is that it?

00:14:34.730 --> 00:14:39.940
<b>Balmung Fezalion
Also known as the Black Wind.</b>

00:14:35.770 --> 00:14:37.480
There's a bell on his neck.

00:14:37.480 --> 00:14:39.940
Wait a sec! Isn't that 
Balmung Fezalion?!

00:14:40.240 --> 00:14:42.730
How did they find him?!

00:14:42.730 --> 00:14:43.980
And he's real?!

00:14:43.980 --> 00:14:46.490
Why would a banana work as 
bait for a dark knight?!

00:14:46.870 --> 00:14:48.300
It's Balmung!

00:14:48.300 --> 00:14:51.540
Later becomes the Brutal 
Emperor Kaiser Fakinaway!

00:14:51.540 --> 00:14:54.730
Seriously, how did he 
mistake that for a monkey?

00:14:54.730 --> 00:14:56.250
What do we do?

00:14:56.250 --> 00:14:57.440
This is bad.

00:14:57.440 --> 00:14:59.330
Balmung's glaring at us.

00:14:59.330 --> 00:15:01.760
His third eye is glaring at us, too.

00:15:01.960 --> 00:15:02.890
Oh no!

00:15:02.890 --> 00:15:03.970
Once his third eye is open,

00:15:03.970 --> 00:15:05.830
it will bring another 
Catastrophe of Sephiroth!

00:15:05.830 --> 00:15:07.220
Hey! Somebody apologize to him!

00:15:07.220 --> 00:15:08.420
Go tell him we got the wrong guy

00:15:08.420 --> 00:15:10.020
before he starts the 
Catastrophe of Sephiroth!

00:15:10.190 --> 00:15:12.320
Hell Fakinaway!

00:15:12.320 --> 00:15:12.890
Oh, shit!

00:15:12.890 --> 00:15:14.740
He's going to use Hell Fakinaway!

00:15:14.740 --> 00:15:18.080
That's bad! Hell Fakinaway is bad!

00:15:20.000 --> 00:15:22.030
You're also gonna throw shit?!

00:15:22.030 --> 00:15:24.130
Balmung is throwing shit at us!

00:15:24.130 --> 00:15:26.220
Balmung is throwing a 
shitload of shit at us!

00:15:26.220 --> 00:15:28.410
That wasn't Hell Fakinaway!

00:15:28.410 --> 00:15:30.540
He's no different from those monkeys!

00:15:30.810 --> 00:15:31.540
Wait!

00:15:31.660 --> 00:15:36.000
<b>Issac Schneider
Also known as the Prince of Light.</b>

00:15:32.490 --> 00:15:34.140
Enough of this.

00:15:34.140 --> 00:15:35.700
Th-That's...!

00:15:35.700 --> 00:15:37.200
Issac Schneider!

00:15:37.200 --> 00:15:39.800
Hasegawa-san brought 
us the Prince of Light

00:15:39.800 --> 00:15:42.070
who was able to turn Balmung 
back to the side of light!

00:15:42.070 --> 00:15:42.880
Everything's okay.

00:15:43.200 --> 00:15:46.390
Whew, they're going to 
talk things through.

00:15:46.740 --> 00:15:47.460
Now we can relax...

00:15:47.460 --> 00:15:49.390
Here's our...

00:15:49.390 --> 00:15:51.000
Bad Communication!

00:15:51.000 --> 00:15:52.890
What kind of shit are 
you trying to pull?!

00:15:53.130 --> 00:15:55.770
Issac is just a monkey!

00:15:56.050 --> 00:15:58.590
And why is Hasegawa-san throwing shit?!

00:15:58.590 --> 00:16:01.280
What kind of Bad Communication is this?!

00:16:02.840 --> 00:16:03.780
Gin-chan!

00:16:04.110 --> 00:16:07.780
We've been surrounded 
by so many monkeys!

00:16:10.780 --> 00:16:14.290
Hey! Somebody do something!

00:16:19.030 --> 00:16:20.250
Th-This is...?

00:16:20.630 --> 00:16:22.360
Tojo, everyone...

00:16:22.700 --> 00:16:25.040
Thank you for serving as decoys.

00:16:25.500 --> 00:16:28.010
We were able to capture 
all of the monkeys.

00:16:28.380 --> 00:16:29.430
Kyubei-san!

00:16:29.430 --> 00:16:31.040
Monkeys, huh?

00:16:31.040 --> 00:16:33.060
There were three idiots mixed in there.

00:16:33.320 --> 00:16:35.120
Wow! So many!

00:16:35.120 --> 00:16:36.160
So many monkeys!

00:16:36.160 --> 00:16:39.230
Hmph, took you long enough.

00:16:39.230 --> 00:16:41.360
Is the young master's monkey in there?

00:16:41.360 --> 00:16:42.940
Yes, most likely.

00:16:43.250 --> 00:16:46.150
But we won't be able to 
identify which one is his.

00:16:46.150 --> 00:16:47.360
What do we do?

00:16:47.360 --> 00:16:48.920
Look for a bell.

00:16:48.920 --> 00:16:51.580
He should be the only one that's wearing a bell.

00:16:54.280 --> 00:16:55.430
Curses!

00:16:55.430 --> 00:16:57.830
Clever little rascal.

00:16:57.970 --> 00:17:01.970
Goku, you don't want to be my pet?

00:17:01.970 --> 00:17:03.840
You don't like me?

00:17:05.780 --> 00:17:08.470
That's not the problem.

00:17:10.610 --> 00:17:13.030
It's just that there's 
someone who he doesn't want

00:17:13.030 --> 00:17:15.380
to be separated from, who 
he loves more than you.

00:17:15.380 --> 00:17:16.230
Kagura-chan!

00:17:16.720 --> 00:17:17.770
Little girl!

00:17:17.770 --> 00:17:20.420
How dare you insult Lord Mori Mori?!

00:17:20.420 --> 00:17:22.610
Let me educate you!

00:17:22.610 --> 00:17:25.150
This is the nephew of the Shogun, Lord Shige Shige...

00:17:25.150 --> 00:17:26.190
Shut up, Gramps!

00:17:26.500 --> 00:17:27.490
Y-Yes...

00:17:29.130 --> 00:17:31.880
Is that true, Yagyu guy?

00:17:31.880 --> 00:17:32.580
Huh?

00:17:32.970 --> 00:17:34.740
Uh, well...

00:17:35.530 --> 00:17:40.810
That means I took Goku away 
from someone he cares about.

00:17:41.290 --> 00:17:44.250
No wonder he ran away.

00:17:45.490 --> 00:17:47.110
Sorry, Goku.

00:17:47.110 --> 00:17:49.370
I'm always stuck inside the castle,

00:17:49.370 --> 00:17:51.800
so I never had any friends to play with.

00:17:52.270 --> 00:17:54.910
So when I saw Soyo-chan's monkey,

00:17:54.910 --> 00:17:56.410
I got really jealous.

00:17:58.120 --> 00:18:02.680
I just wanted to be your friend.

00:18:02.680 --> 00:18:06.100
But I ended up taking you 
away from your friend.

00:18:06.100 --> 00:18:07.440
I'm sorry.

00:18:11.760 --> 00:18:14.700
Lord Mori Mori, please stop crying.

00:18:15.470 --> 00:18:18.830
He doesn't hate you,

00:18:18.830 --> 00:18:21.830
and he isn't unwilling 
to be your friend.

00:18:23.700 --> 00:18:25.690
That's not the problem.

00:18:26.120 --> 00:18:27.460
But his name...

00:18:28.210 --> 00:18:33.080
He has a wonderful name 
that carries the hopes and

00:18:33.080 --> 00:18:34.910
dreams that were given 
to him by his friends.

00:18:35.350 --> 00:18:37.430
Will you call his name with me?

00:18:38.660 --> 00:18:40.170
Ready and...

00:18:40.170 --> 00:18:42.370
Jugem Jugem Shit-Tossing the

00:18:42.370 --> 00:18:45.140
Life of Shin-chan's 
Two-Day-Old Underwear

00:18:45.140 --> 00:18:47.310
Balmung Fezalion Issac Schneider

00:18:47.310 --> 00:18:51.880
1/3 True Love 2/3 Hangnail Anxiety

00:18:51.880 --> 00:18:55.440
Betrayal Knows My Name Or Does It Really

00:18:55.440 --> 00:18:58.310
Ignore Calls Squid Dogfish 
Halibut Trout-Cod Dogfish...

00:18:58.310 --> 00:19:00.120
This Is a Different Dogfish,

00:19:00.120 --> 00:19:01.620
I'm Talking About The Dogfish Shark

00:19:01.620 --> 00:19:02.250
Kaluga Angler Ray

00:19:02.250 --> 00:19:05.820
Yuuteimiyaoukimukou 
Pepepepepepepepepepepepe

00:19:05.820 --> 00:19:07.880
Runny Diarrhea.

00:19:07.900 --> 00:19:08.940
Yeah, he can't say that.

00:19:08.940 --> 00:19:09.580
He can't say that.

00:19:09.580 --> 00:19:11.260
Lord Mori Mori can't say that.

00:19:20.790 --> 00:19:22.060
Diarrhea...

00:19:23.180 --> 00:19:27.970
Jugem Genome Barbossa Fanta 
Pipipipipipipi Barf Diarrhea!

00:19:27.970 --> 00:19:28.990
He made up a name!

00:19:28.990 --> 00:19:30.980
Lord Mori Mori couldn't remember 
the name so he made one up!

00:19:30.980 --> 00:19:32.240
I'm sorry!

00:19:32.240 --> 00:19:34.010
I'm sorry about what I did!

00:19:34.010 --> 00:19:36.050
I'm sorry about getting your name wrong!

00:19:43.580 --> 00:19:45.120
Here you go, Yagyu guy.

00:19:46.630 --> 00:19:48.000
Lord Mori Mori?!

00:19:48.710 --> 00:19:49.590
It's okay.

00:19:50.040 --> 00:19:53.830
I don't want to see my friends look sad,

00:19:53.830 --> 00:19:55.430
whether it's Barf Diarrhea

00:19:55.430 --> 00:19:56.890
or the Yagyu guy.

00:19:57.640 --> 00:20:02.890
Besides, I can't remember 
such a long name yet.

00:20:08.680 --> 00:20:10.100
In return...

00:20:10.480 --> 00:20:14.700
Uh, Yagyu guy...  I have a favor to ask.

00:20:14.700 --> 00:20:15.860
What is it?

00:20:16.260 --> 00:20:20.380
Uh, could you let me add to his name?

00:20:24.960 --> 00:20:27.540
Jugem Jugem Shit-Tossing the

00:20:27.540 --> 00:20:30.610
Life of Shin-chan's 
Two-Day-Old Underwear

00:20:30.610 --> 00:20:33.280
Balmung Fezalion Issac Schneider

00:20:33.280 --> 00:20:38.180
1/3 True Love 2/3 Hangnail Anxiety

00:20:38.180 --> 00:20:42.130
Betrayal Knows My Name Or Does It Really

00:20:42.130 --> 00:20:45.380
Ignore Calls Squid Dogfish 
Halibut Trout-Cod Dogfish...

00:20:45.380 --> 00:20:47.520
This Is a Different Dogfish,

00:20:47.520 --> 00:20:49.180
I'm Talking About The Dogfish Shark

00:20:49.180 --> 00:20:49.760
Kaluga Angler Ray

00:20:49.760 --> 00:20:54.110
Yuuteimiyaoukimukou
Pepepepepepepepepepepepe

00:20:54.110 --> 00:20:58.440
All's Well That Ends 
Well Runny Diarrhea.

00:21:04.120 --> 00:21:06.040
<b>The End</b>

00:22:36.090 --> 00:22:41.550
<b>Ask Mr. Ginpachi</b>

00:22:36.980 --> 00:22:39.160
Ask Mr. Ginpachi...

00:22:39.160 --> 00:22:41.550
...is back!

00:22:42.010 --> 00:22:45.270
Okay, we have a little time 
leftover so I'll read a postcard.

00:22:45.610 --> 00:22:49.460
From someone with the pen name 
"Okita-kun Love Pudding."

00:22:49.460 --> 00:22:50.500
I have a question.

00:22:50.500 --> 00:22:54.000
Couldn't you write out 
Odd Jobs with two kanji?

00:22:54.450 --> 00:22:58.260
Why do you use three?

00:22:58.260 --> 00:22:59.720
Please tell me why.

00:22:59.720 --> 00:23:02.330
Okay, here's your answer.

00:23:02.330 --> 00:23:05.470
Originally, it was just two kanji,

00:23:05.470 --> 00:23:07.170
but people might mistake us for some

00:23:07.170 --> 00:23:10.110
kind of general store 
that sells everything.

00:23:10.110 --> 00:23:12.250
We're supposed to be a bunch of people

00:23:12.250 --> 00:23:13.940
who are willing to do everything.

00:23:13.940 --> 00:23:18.190
So we added the extra 
kanji to differentiate.

00:23:18.190 --> 00:23:19.560
Well, the result is that

00:23:19.560 --> 00:23:24.240
our various guests keep reading 
it wrong in the script.

00:23:24.840 --> 00:23:28.690
I should mention that a lot of 
people also read Amanto wrong.

00:23:30.020 --> 00:23:39.150
<b>Next Episode</b>

00:23:30.510 --> 00:23:32.310
The maid was watching

00:23:32.310 --> 00:23:34.520
when the man who is feared 
as the Destroyer of Edo

00:23:34.520 --> 00:23:35.790
revealed his true nature.

00:23:35.790 --> 00:23:39.150
A shocking truth about the father...

00:23:39.150 --> 00:23:39.760
Next time:

00:23:39.150 --> 00:23:44.990
<b>The Man's Household Situation 
is Hard, His Heart is Soft</b>

00:23:39.760 --> 00:23:43.650
The man's household situation 
is hard, his heart is soft.
